    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_29> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_6> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_7> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_9> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Running two systems at one desk for a few weeks is a known, contained pain with a named owner. Two cutovers landing in the same week is an unbounded one, and we've got nobody to hand it to." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_13> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We do this one site at a time. A site goes live, it soaks, and only when that soak is clean do we start the next one. No parallel cutovers, not even for the two small ones." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_8> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Two cutovers in the same week means eight of eleven are on cutover duty, and the other three are covering four sites' worth of normal operations plus whatever the first cutover is still coughing up." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_11> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Last week you were arguing it as risk. I'm telling you it's arithmetic. One site at a time is the only sequencing my rota can actually produce people for." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_14> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "I'd rather hold two weeks and shorten it with evidence than hold one week and discover we needed two." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_22> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "a commitment that a soak doesn't get shortened because a date slipped" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_28> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The counter-pressure that started it: the shared dispatch desk makes running two sites together genuinely tempting, and the desk supervisor has been objecting since June." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_12> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The two-week soak rests on a single pilot — one site, one season — and that evidentiary thinness is on the record, answered by a preference to lengthen first rather than discover the shortfall live." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_21> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_22> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The strongest argument is conditional: if staffing eased, its holder would still choose one-at-a-time but say it less strongly — the hard constraint and the preference are not the same claim." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_22> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The sequencing rules silently assume one cutover window at a time; going parallel would require rewriting the replica and reference-data rules, not just revisiting the schedule." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_25> ] ;
    narr:writer "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash:nitro" .
}